  "details": "World creators should be able to set up their own action menus, just like Avatar creators can. Creating a standard menu system for all complex worlds instead of the current wild west of menu systems.\n\nAdjust the 4 options in the root Action Menu to contain Tools (up), Avatar Expressions (Right), Emotes (Down), and World Menu (Left if set up in the world). Tools would have to be adjusted to create sub menus for the current settings menu, probably at diagonal directions in the menu.\n\nThis would allow world creators to put all post process customization, collider toggles, video player controllers, etc somewhere everyone knows to find it. If UDON also lets the world see when the menu is opened/closed, world creators can combine it with current custom menu functionality to still display information is more pleasing ways.",
